Architecture Development Rules

System Design Principles
======================

- Define a clear architectural pattern
- Design systems with clear separation of concerns
- Promote loose coupling and high cohesion
- Design for scalability and future growth
- Design for resilience and fault tolerance
- Prioritize security at all levels
- Ensure maintainability and ease of evolution
- Document the architecture clearly

Component Communication
=====================

- Define clear communication patterns
- Choose appropriate communication technologies
- Implement robust error handling

Data Management
=============

- Choose appropriate data storage solutions
- Design efficient data models and schemas
- Implement data validation and integrity checks
- Consider data security and privacy requirements

